# M2 translation gate, pass/fail (no golden checkpoint): icache_alias, and the
# rv64ui suite in the "v" environment, which runs each test in U-mode under
# Sv39 with demand paging and so drives the ITLB, both walkers and
# fetch/load/store page faults; and the Svpbmt programs (NC and IO pages in
# DRAM, the second one against cached copies of the same line); and the
# Svadu program (hardware A and D updates under menvcfg.ADUE, then Svade).
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]
rv64sip/icache_alias hex=test/riscv-arch-test/build/rv64si/icache-alias.hex
rv64ui_v/add
rv64ui_v/addi
rv64ui_v/addiw
rv64ui_v/addw
rv64ui_v/and
rv64ui_v/andi
rv64ui_v/auipc
